/t_thumb/sc10jxg.jpg"}], "slug": "stella-sora", "storyline": "The storyline of Stella Sora centers on the player, who is an amnesiac demon lord called the \"Tyrant,\" and their adventures with the \"New Star Guild,\" a trio of girls. Players journey through the fantasy world of Nova, exploring mysterious \"Monoliths,\" and discovering the stories of other charming girls called \"Trekkers\". Interactions with the Trekkers through a chat system build intimacy, unlock additional dialogue, and reveal their backstories.", "summary": "In this top-down, light-action adventure game developed by Yostar, play as the Tyrant in a captivating fantasy world. Create memorable bonds with charming girls known as Trekkers, assemble perfect teams for diverse adventures, and conquer the mysterious Monoliths. Packed with exhilarating battles, randomized perks each run, and a variety of in-game features, Stella Sora will keep you coming back for more. Tyrant, your legacy awaits!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/stella-sora", "videos": [{"id": 135971, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "kqItc-1ZdTw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kqItc-1ZdTw", "title": "Stella Sora Concept PV\u300cTo the endless sky\u300d", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kqItc-1ZdTw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 135970, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "aJnRP0R76u8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aJnRP0R76u8", "title": "Stella Sora Teaser PV\u300cReturn of the Tyrant\u300d", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aJnRP0R76u8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 135972, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "rs40AGfEv60", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rs40AGfEv60", "title": "\u2728Stella Sora Gameplay Trailer\u2728", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rs40AGfEv60/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165596, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "zyiEq1_IzdE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zyiEq1_IzdE", "title": "Stella Sora Of